At 8:15, Mara left the west window open while she checked the clay samples. The
morning light moved across the worktable, and the glaze notes stayed easy to
find in the [studio log](./structured.record.card).

She marked three small decisions before lunch:

- keep the cobalt test tile
- move the kiln check to Thursday
- bring the cracked cup to the next review

> The work gets clearer when the table has room to change.

{% quote from="Rowan Vale" %}
Make room for the next useful thing.
{% /quote %}
